==English==
{{was wotd|2011|October|18}}
===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|stipulatus|stipulātus|lang=la}}, perfect active participle of {{term|stipulor||lang=la|I demand a guarantee}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|/ˈstɪpjuˌleɪt/|/ˈstɪpjəˌleɪt/}}

====Verb====
{{en-verb|stipulat|es}}

# To [[require]] (something) as a [[condition]] of a [[contract]] or [[agreement]].
# To [[specify]], [[promise]] or [[guarantee]] something in an agreement.
# To [[acknowledge]] the truth of; not to [[challenge]].

=====Derived terms=====
* [[stipulated]]
* [[stipulation]]
* [[stipulative]]

